SUMMARY:Equestrian Camp at Linden Hall
DESCRIPTION:Camp encompasses a variety of riding and horsemanship learning opportunities. Whether a new or experienced rider\, each camper participates in activities that greatly expand her equestrian knowledge. \nIn addition to leveled riding lessons each day\, participants attend field trips\, hear from guest speakers\, and engage in a variety of hands-on horsemanship activities. \nIn the evenings\, equestrian campers join with other Summer at Linden Hall participants for crafts\, campfires\, water games\, and team-building activities for a time of bonding and fun. \nAdditionally\, Equestrian Overnight Camp is adding a second week to coincide with the second week of GIRLS Camp. Campers are welcome for one or both weeks\, and they will now have the chance to mix and match weeks between Equestrian and GIRLS Camp. \nCampers who register for both weeks of either camp will receive a $25 second-week discount. Housing is also available during the weekend between camps (July 17-19) for $260. Day camp is open to campers in grades 2-8\, and overnight camp is open to girls grades 3-8. \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!\n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/equestrian-camp-linden-hall/
LOCATION:Linden Hall School for Girls\, 212 E. Main Street\, Lititz\, PA\, 17543\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Lititz, Pennsylvania,Summer Camp
