SUMMARY:Soccer Camp at Linden Hall
DESCRIPTION:Beginning in 2026\, Linden Hall will offer two co-ed Sports Camps – Sports Variety Camp and Soccer Camp!\nThe soccer camp will be led by the Varsity Soccer coach\, Mr. Jameson E. Beates. Coach Beates played collegiate soccer at Geneva College and was formerly the Varsity Boys’ Soccer Head Coach at Wyomissing High School in Berks County. \nThe focus of the camp will be skill development\, with each day having a specific focus\, such as ball-control and dribbling\, shooting and finishing\, defense and team tactics\, etc. \nEach morning will begin with dynamic warmups and speed/agility training\, followed by drills attuned to each day’s focused skill. \nThis camp is a wonderful opportunity! \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!\n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar
