DESCRIPTION:Beginner Sessions (Ages 8-12)\nMonday through Friday 9:00am – 12:30pm\, with a Saturday morning performance. \n\nJuly 13 – 18 (Beginner Session)\nJuly 20 – 25 (Beginner Session)\nAugust 3 – 8 (Beginner Session)\n\nThis session is for those who have always wanted to act but have never gotten the chance or who have had limited performance experience. This class will introduce you to the tools an actor needs in order to perform on stage. Students will work singing\, dancing\, and acting\, creating a fun-filled musical revue to perform at the end of the week for family and friends.
