SUMMARY:Aaron Lewis and The Stateliners - American Music Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Aaron Lewis\, the Vermont-born powerhouse first found success with Staind–the 2000s-era hard-rockers who injected meditative muscle into an era better known for mindless aggression. But while that band is still very much alive\, it was never enough to satisfy Lewis’ creative drive. \nEmbracing his roots to earn a rare second round of success\, a series of solo country projects have led to two No. 1 Billboard Country Album debuts–TOWN LINE (2011) and SINNER(2016)–plus a PLATINUM collab with heroes George Jones and Charlie Daniels (“Country Boy”)\, and a GOLD-certified Billboard No. 1 with “Am I The Only One” in 2021. Lewis’ 2022 solo album followed suit\, with FRAYED AT BOTH ENDS emerging as the best-selling Country album in America but he never wrote songs for the stats. No matter the sonic setting\, Lewis writes andsings to get his truth out and his latest album THE HILL(2024) is no different. \nVIP1:  Aaron Lewis Side Stage Experience: $402 \n\nOne (1) Premium Reserved ticket in the first row\nExclusive Side Stage viewing opportunity for three songs.\nAutographed Setlist\nVIP Express lane – first entry at doors\nVIP Express lane – at designated merch stand\nExclusive VIP Merchandise\nLimited Edition Commemorative Laminate & Lanyard\n\nVIP 2: Aaron Lewis Early Entry + Merch Package $237 \n\nOne (1) Premium Reserved ticket (Rows 1-15)\nVIP Express lane – first entry at doors\nVIP Express lane – at designated merch stand\nExclusive VIP Merchandise\nLimited Edition Commemorative Laminate & Lanyard\n\n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/aaron-lewis-american-music-theatre/
